OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, frosty but dry and
OL,6,Fbright start to the day, with long
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Some hill fog over
OL,8,Fwestern hills. Cloud will start to
OL,9,Fbuild from around midday, though
OL,10,Fremaining dry. Breezy, strengthening
OL,11,Flater.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy overnight
OL,14,Fwith outbreaks of rain arriving from
OL,15,Fthe west, potentially heavy at times.
OL,16,FStrong winds. Cold with a further
OL,17,Ffrost likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
