OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FPatchy cloud and a few
OL,6,Flingering showers over the Pennines.
OL,7,FOtherwise, bright with sunny intervals
OL,8,Fand winds falling light.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FGenerally
OL,11,Fcloudy, with a chance of outbreaks of
OL,12,Frain or showers, but also a few
OL,13,Fbrighter spells. Light to moderate
OL,14,Fwinds, with temperatures around
OL,15,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
